<title>JAPAN: Chubu Steel to issue 4 bln convertible.</title>
<headline>Chubu Steel to issue 4 bln convertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER--Chubu Steel Plate Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Tokai Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   1	  AMT    4 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISSU PRICE	    MATURITY 28.Sep.01</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Nov.96   CONV TO 27.Sep.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 30.Sep.96  INT PAY end-Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 20-27 Sep</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The terms will be decided on September 19.</p>
</text>
